  {
   "id": "the-shapeshifting-detective-105629@post-2018-11-14",
   "gameId": "the-shapeshifting-detective-105629",
   "displayName": "New Feature: Skip Scene",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2018-11-14T12:20:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Calling all fans of -",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "SKIP",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've added a highly requested feature to be able to -",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "SKIP",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This feature will be unlocked after you have completed one full playthrough of the game and -",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "SKIP",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please note this will skip individual responses and skipping a response is entirely your own choice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're now just a week into the release of The Shapeshifting Detective and we're proving once again that FMV is here to stay 🤩 The game has now surpassed 100 Steam very positive reviews 🏆 So we'd like to take a moment to thank you all for your support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game has received some pretty incredible reviews already, here's just a few...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "“The Shapeshifting Detective is a shining light in immersive story-telling. The shapeshifting mechanic and how it is integrated into the story really sets it apart” 4.5/5 – The Xbox Hub",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "“A great FMV title to enjoy multiple times over and over. By changing the murderer each time I would restart the game I felt like I was playing a game of Clue” 8/10 – PlayStation Universe",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "“Alluring characters and enthralling narrative that dances with supernatural themes” 8/10 – Game Spew",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for additional languages to be added to the game. If anyone from the community has a particular language they'd love to see in the game, or if anyone is interested in translating the game, please get in touch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wales Interactive",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
